+**gemini-code** turns the terminal into a mission-control center for software engineering. It is designed for developers who want the speed of an autonomous agent with the safety and oversight of a flight deck.
 
-![Gemini CLI Screenshot](/docs/assets/gemini-screenshot.png)
+## 🚀 Headline Features: Safe Autonomy
 
-Gemini CLI is an open-source AI agent that brings the power of Gemini directly
-into your terminal. It provides lightweight access to Gemini, giving you the
-most direct path from your prompt to our model.
+### 🛡️ Autopilot Command Gate
+Never worry about an agent running a destructive command behind your back. The **Autopilot Gate** classifies every shell command before execution:
+- **Auto-Allow**: Simple read-only operations (status, logs, directory listing) run silently.
+- **Auto-Deny**: Dangerous operations (`rm -rf`, `sudo`, `git push`) are blocked by policy.
+- **Ask/Defer**: Everything else requires oversight.
 
-Learn all about Gemini CLI in our [documentation](https://geminicli.com/docs/).
+### 📥 Deferred Command Queue (v3)
+Unattended modes (Shower, School, or Night mode) no longer stall. When a command requires approval, gemini-code **defers** it to a background queue and continues with other safe tasks. You can review and approve the entire queue once you're back.
 
